e":"2017-07-01T03:50:13-07:00","id":1110118,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><u><b>Name: Sir. Edward Clay</b></u> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Born before the two world wars. Edward Clay had a child hood filled with enough love to get him through the darkest parts of the war. Falling in love at 15 he married his sweet heart Violet before he left with so many other men into what was known as the great war. He worked hard to become a solider that she could be proud of. After he completed his training his company was set up in the town of Norfolk. Days into company being stationed in Norfolk soldiers in his company went missing. Believed to have been taken by local wolves. Edward gained the interest of the towns Baroness know as Lilith Hoffman. The Baroness would invite him and off duty solider to relax on her estate. She spent her time slowly seducing Edward to capture his attention and make him fall in love. Before her seduction could be completed a large-scale battle hits the town and he's thrust into a horrific battle. The Enemy used gas and other weapons. Even though his company won the battle the horror of the battle left mental scaring that would live with Edward for the rest of this days. The next day the enemy came again but this time stronger and with more troops. His company was able to bring the enemy to a standstill at great cost to the company and himself. The battle left Edward on the brink of death. A sniper took Edwards Right eye, A Blast from a tank took his left thumb and leaving him with a large scar on his head and head Injury. All of this because he drew the enemy's attention to save some pinned solders. A Kindred hired by Lilith to find Edward and make sure he lived and to help him. Seeing the extent of the damage done to Edward and his refusal to die the kindred known as The Nurse fed him their blood. It was deemed a miracle when overnight Edward went from being on deaths door step a broken man to not only being healthy but stronger then over. The next 2 battles lead him to gaining an infield promotion due to his commanding officer being slain in battle. The Final battle made him a hero to his company but he was also believed to have died during the last battle of Norfolk. In reality was taken by the Germany military. Brought before German military command he was given a mock trial in a military court just to mock him. He was charged with espionage and terrorism. He was placed in jail where he was tortured by the German military for over 10 days. Where upon he rose as a kindred. This gained the interest of German scientists. Edward went from prisoner to lab rat. For the next 27 years he was subject to inhuman experimentation. 2 decades in he can to the attention of a German Scientist known as Josef Mengele. Edward was held for a total of 27 years before he was broken free a splinter group of Ordo Dracul. He was smuggled back to Britain. He learns what he is now and of what the Nazis are using kindred blood to do. Knowing he can't go back and wanting revenge. He convinces the Ordo Dracul of Britain to help him. They give him assets and a team to begin hunting down all the scientists who experimented on him and erasing all the data the Nazi's gathered on kindred. In his quest he gathered many other kindred who were seeking revenge on the Nazi's also. A Gangrel named <b>Harper Collins</b> but everyone called him Riper who acted as the groups heavy weapons expert, A Daeva spy who went by the name <b>Willow</b> who kept the team well-informed on enemy activates, <b>Max Wells</b> a Ventrue seeking to pay back a debt and was acting as the face of the group and two Nosferatu Twins <b>Sarah Sutherland</b> and <b>Penelope Sutherland</b> who were collectivity known as Death, they acted as the groups snipers. Over years of working together they became like family. Him and his group destroyed strong hold after strong hold and helped damage the Nazis as Edward continued to search for Josef Mengele. For the Next 5 years they marched through hellish battlefields each seeking something. Edward found the man he was seeking in a small town deep behind German lines. This was the revenge he sought but when it was within his grasp he was betrayed by Willow. Who unknown to group was captured and replaced by a German spy known as Angel. She let him come face to face with the man he was seeking before she put Edward into Torpor. The doctors plans were dashed when his team was able to recover him before they could spirit Edward off. Damage done and Edward now in torpor. The Ordo stored his body for what he had done to help the ordo.</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UTX6I2q.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"imag