=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">-3</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">~</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">N/A</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span></div></td> </tr> </table></div> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Equipment On Person:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Equipment:</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Gadgets:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name: </b>Flesh Shaper</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Hardware:</b> Gloves</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Embed or Exploit Used: </b>Inflict Stigmata + Hellhounds</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Activation or Trigger: </b>Coating the gloves in blood</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Effect: </b>Near Field of Inflict Stigmata and Hellhounds this gadget allows the wielder to reshape the flesh of target. This Gadget with a skilled hand can create useful and beautiful stigmata's for a stigmatic or create full horror of a cryptid. This Takes an Extended roll of Medicine + Intelligence the target number is set by the GM<br /> Each roll is an hour</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name:</b> A New You</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Hardware:</b> Surgical Blade</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Embed or Exploit Used:</b> Identity Theft + Going Native</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Activation or Trigger:</b> Spending Aether </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Effect:</b> Near Field of Identity Theft and Going Native allows the user to take parts of pacts they own to give a target a new identity. This takes an extended roll of Medicine + Intelligence the target number is set by the GM. The demon can change anything about the person for example: Height, Weight, Gender, Race and so on. Each roll is an hour</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name:</b> Salvager</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Hardware:</b> Surgical Blade</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Embed or Exploit Used:</b> Rise Dead</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Activation or Trigger:</b> speaking ritual words</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Effect:</b> Near Field of </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Rise Dead</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">. This gadget allows the user to take covers from dead demons salvaging what's left of their current cover. This is done by an Extended Occult + Intelligence Roll Target Number equal to cover rating of demon + days dead Each roll is an hour</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name:</b> Salvager 2.0</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Hardware:</b> Surgical Blade</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Embed or Exploit Used:</b> Rise Dead</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Activation or Trigger:</b> speaking ritual words</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Effect:</b> Near Field of </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Rise Dead</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">. This gadget allows the user to take covers from the dead salvaging what's left to create a cover. This is done by an Extended Occult + Intelligence Roll Target days dead Each roll is an hour.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name:</b> Upgrader</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Hardware:</b> Surgical Stapler</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Embed or Exploit Used:</b> Merge + Show Of Power</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Activation or Trigger:</b> Tracing Inscription on side with fingers</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Effect:</b> Near Field of Merge and Show of Power. This gadget allows the user to take abilities from other supernaturals and merge them into a target. For Example Installing werewolves claws, vampire teeth, Promethean heart into a subject get x effect that is negotiated with the GM. Extended roll to remove said feature from one target is an extended roll of Dex + Medicine target number set by GM, Each roll is an hour. Then to install it into a subject is Intelligence + Medicine roll Target number set by GM and each roll is an hour</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name:</b> Personality Tweeker</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Hardware:</b> Brain Electrode</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Embed or Exploit Used:</b> Affliction</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Activation or Trigger:</b> Pushing the Hidden Switch on the Brain Electrode</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Effect: </b>Near Field that allows the user of this gadget too tweak a targets vice and virtue. The Electrode is placed at the base of the skull and the user roll Med + Intelligence Extended roll GM sets the Difficulty. Each roll takes 1 hour. Success the user can change the vice or virtue of the victim. An Exceptional Success allows the user to upload a new aspiration into the user. The brain is such a malleable thing</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Description: </b>Tall and Lanky, Cold Storm Colored eye, The Doctor has Black hair that is slowly giving away to grey. He has no muscle tone. His skin pale as a corpse but he has dark circles under his eyes. When he smiles he looks charming but when he's not smiling he gives off a creepy aura.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Conditions: </b>Obsession (Experimentation)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Short Term Aspirations: </b>Get a new assistant, Gain Trust of land lords wife, Salvage Neighbors dead daughter as a cover.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Long Term Aspiration: </b>Build an Immortal Cover</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Bio: </b>Cobbler works as a plastic surgeon during the day and at night works as doctor to the demonic community. Everyone in the demonic community knows he gives top quality covers but everyone is scared to ask where he gets them so quickly. For some of his best covers he requires strange favors. The Doctor is a creature of experimentation. Taking humans and stigmatic's to warp their flesh and find the limits of their biology. He once worked for the god-machine creating covers bits of human lives but now he builds them from what he can salvage be it those who come in wanting to upgrade their flesh to corpses who lives he believes ended too soon. His work as a Plastic surgeon has garnered him fame and money but more importantly giving him the clout to persuade others to change more than their looks. The new place he lives he has got his eye on the land lords wife a beautiful woman who could be improved and the Neighbors dead daughter who was gunned down by gang members on her way to school. Cobbler enjoys finding Victorian splinters and playing doctor back then. The Flesh more supple back then to him. Cobbler is obsessive about being clean and must keep all this tools and operating theater clean,<br /> <br /> Dr. </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Cobbler Song</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Kids have started to sing this song around where the doctor lives<br /> <br /> Dr. </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Cobbler Song</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">When everyone was tucked up tight</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">and darkness ate up all the light</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I wiggled and I wormed my way outside...</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">But the boy whose head, inside I hid</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Is no longer a tiny kid,</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Today the age of sixty-five...</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Oh brains as old as these</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">are susceptible to mental disease</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">So now my master's mute... Locked in an institute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I will show them all!</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I've discovered a ruse</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">to leave this body in which whose</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">head I've been a resident for many years...</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">If I just collect the goodies</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">from inside six other boogies</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I can build myself a skin and leave from here...</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Oh just you wait and see,</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">all the skin belongs... to me...</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">So I shall search these halls for other Boogie souls</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I will show them all!</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Covers:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Name: Dr. Carlos P. Graham</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Age: 40</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Appearance:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Merits:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Notes: </span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 09-21-2017, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T15:04:26-07:00","id":1127794,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b><u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Edward S. Hager</span></u></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Born in \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Edward Hager joined the military at \u25a0\u25a0 years old with his family's permission. In his training he showed his true potential. It was not long before he was adopted into \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Training. Right out of \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 training he was put into the field for 5 years. During this time he distinguished himself during operation (\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0) \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 \u25a0 \u25a0\u25a0 \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 team mates </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">w</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">ere </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">. He not only completed the mission on his own but managed to get </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> out of the hot zone, extract an </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> and get his team out. This mission brought him to attention of </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">. Completing his training he worked with </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> on </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> Operations around the world in only </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u25a0\u25a0</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> years. After meeting his wife Isabella and having 8 children with her he retired from active duty and started his own security business where him and Ex other military Veterans work as body guards for any company looking for security. Currently he his company does Personal Security for Sir. Alexander F. Stone for the last 10 years. The two have become close friends. Edward works hard to provide for his wife and kids and running this business allows him time to spend with them but he does miss being in the field and will sometimes work actively as Sir Stones Body guard without telling his wife.</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Sp