son was a blood boy and came in every now again to get health screenings for their business. Curious she started asking the young man questions and as each one was answered an idea formed in her mind. Seducing a boy who had a crush on her at her school she got him to help her start collecting and editing hospital records so she could steal equipment and lists of the richest clients the hospital has. It only took her a few months to get everything set and being underselling the blood boys each one of the clients had. So now she has clients and even convinced the young fit men in her area to give her blood and would pay them a faction of what it was worth and kept most of the profit for herself. Her world became blood and money from 16 years old till now. Now that she had the capital she needed power. As she keeps her blood business stable by taking from the poor and selling to the rich. Now she has begun making contacts with other rich clients to expand her business. In the clubs she seduces the young and affluent now and convinces them to sell their blood to her also. This gained her the attention of a powerful person in her city that now has started giving her type orders on what he wants. This client has open her door to a whole new clientele. She does not know if they have some strange medical condition or rich people who enjoy playing vampire. She does not care as long as they have the cash she will provide what they want.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">*Most likely being watched by the Invictus or some other powerful vampire patrons. </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":""