-wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; width: 1px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Name</b></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Level</b></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> </tr> </table></div> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Vinculum:</b></span><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; width: 1px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Bound to</b></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>State</b></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> </tr> </table></div> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Banes: </b>The Wanton Curse</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Short Term Aspirations: </b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Long Term Aspiration:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Description: </b>Nancy is a thin and beautiful woman. Where other Daeva have beauty its Nancy's innocence that takes people off guard. She always has on something light and ethereal. Even in modern times she always keeps a pocket watch her father made for her when she was younger. Her voice is light like wind chimes and her eyes soft blue. Nancy skin is alabaster but her hair seems to change between dirty blond and brown throughout the seasons. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Bio: </b>Nancy was a beautiful pianist in the 1920's she played a night clubs throughout France. Her magical voice and other worldly piano skills drew the attention of her sire. He quickly became obsessed with her and before he learned about her he turned her. It was only a few months after that he learned that she touched mentally and soon that lead to malkavia taking hold in her. In innocence coupled with her beauty drew man victims to her but it was her killing of an elder that marked her for destruction. The kindred community was whole did not wish to lose such musical talent that her sire was forced to take the blame. Now she is kept under guard by the Invictus, She is watched over by armed guards and kept happy as she continues to play her music for the princes guests. Everyone who seems to view her wants to own her but understanding that her wanting of her owns you. In her city when she is allowed to play at small venues she is called the lady in white. When she plays it has another worldly quality to it some believe that her malkavia allows her hear and play music from the past but also future. As some have noticed that she will sometimes play songs that become very popular only a few years to a decade or more later. Her malkavia makes it hard for her to resist the urge to feed and as such her guards tries to keep others away from her but sometimes a little mouse will stray to close. These nights she has become obsessed with the wife of her last victim. She spends many nights talking to Kimberly and plays music for her</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Roleplay Notes:</b> Nancy Speaks in a French accent and speaks like she always is thinking about so many other things and she is only vaguely aware of those around her. She also has the ability to see of future events and will sometimes put them in her music.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Kimberly is now a hunter seeking out the one who killed her husband but has no idea that Nancy is the one who did it. <br /> </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T04:13:29-07:00","id":1148552,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><u><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Father Michael S. O'Neill</span></b></u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Michael A. O'Neil was born in Brooklyn New York and grew up in the church because that was the only really safe area for a young man growing up. From the moment he herd the bible verse Psalms 22:19 &quot;O my god I trust in you; Let me not be ashamed Let not my enemies triumph over me&quot;. When he turned 18 he joined up with the military where the horrors of war and combat only strengthened Father O'Neil's faith in the lord and he became known as a The preacher on his military base. He served two tours in the military before returning to civilian life and joining the church fully. Back in the states it was not long before he was assigned to a church in his old neighborhood. Being back home he saw how much drugs and gang violence took a toll on the area so he set forth in his righteous mission to fix the church and bring hope back to the area. It took then a year to fully repair the church like new with the help of Mother Mary a Nun who served in the military like he did. The old gothic church they were given was designed to with war and from here they spread the word of god to the masses. Bring in more followers then the church had seen in a very long time. Father O'Neil made it into the local news for standing between 4 gang members and the man they were attempting to rob a homeless man. He was able to not only talk the men down through the word of the lord but all 4 men turned their life around the joined the church while in jail. Even though he has helped change his neighborhood for the better in the last few months it has taken a stark turn. Gangs have returned to the area, many young people have started using drugs. Seeing this change he set forth to once again try and help his neighborhood but this time forces of devil attacked him. During a late night session during a black out in the city. Two men entered the church and demanded money from the church. The father went along with it taking to two men to where the money was and handing it over. When one of the men became belligerent with one of nuns. The father tried to stop it only be smacked an inhuman distance away. When the father go up the two men in their anger with nun tore her heart out. Sending her blood across the fathers office. Seeing this horror rather than becoming frozen in it. The father reacted and attacked one of the young men hitting him with enough force that the father could hear the man's skull crack. Knocking him to the floor and making him drop the shotgun he had hidden under his clothing. The second man grew claws and slashed off Father O'Neil cutting his chest deeply. Ignoring the pain the father raised the shotgun and fired directly at the man's heart killing him in a single blow. Right before Michael O'Neil's eyes the man became a shriveled corpse. Knowing they were not normal he turned in time to see the other man running inhumanly fast to the door exiting the church. From this day on Father O'Neil has devoted himself to learning about these creatures and to defend himself, the church and everyone else 