ng him with enough force that the father could hear the man's skull crack. Knocking him to the floor and making him drop the shotgun he had hidden under his clothing. The second man grew claws and slashed off Father O'Neil cutting his chest deeply. Ignoring the pain the father raised the shotgun and fired directly at the man's heart killing him in a single blow. Right before Michael O'Neil's eyes the man became a shriveled corpse. Knowing they were not normal he turned in time to see the other man running inhumanly fast to the door exiting the church. From this day on Father O'Neil has devoted himself to learning about these creatures and to defend himself, the church and everyone else from these monsters. </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-29T14:48:09-07:00","id":1153992,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><u><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Eddie Stones</span></b></u></span><br /> Eddie was born into a family that worked at a Japanese consulate. When he was little he learned Karate from one of the best instructors in the country. It was there that his family and instructor saw his talent for fighting. His instructor described him as a force of nature. He hit with the force of flood and drowned you in pain. His family moved around the world due to his father's job. Thank to this Eddie learned multiple languages and fighting styles. This game him an edge in the multiple fighting competitions he took part in. By the time he was 18 he was given a chance to take part in 