ter he used his skills cheat a casino out of a cool million dollars. They threatened to kill him so he left the city. Now he roams the roads gambling in various card games to make money. He met the woman of his dreams. She gave him a rosary the night they had a child. He starting building a life with her when once more Billy pushed his luck in a card game and he lost owing them 20k. He worked to try and pay them off but they sent him a message in the form of killing his girl. Fearing for his child's life he took his kid and ran once more. He found his way into the city and has started hustling to pay for his kid. His hustling has made him a sort of fixer for people on the street for a price. Since his wife's death, he has been getting visions that seem like visions of the future to him. They come to him in uncontrolled bursts and he's yet to figure out what causes them but he has used it to tell peoples futures and every now and again they tell him things that can make him a few bucks. <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 02-12-2018, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T05:18:40-07:00","id":1199347,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:22px\"><u><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Madam Mercurial</span></b></u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Second Born to the house of the Silver Needle. Madam Mercurial from a young age showed a great aptitude for anything she tried even magic. Many saw it as her just having a talent for things but no one saw how many hours she would spend studying and learning to gain the approval of her father. Her father is one of the 13 leaders of the Mysterium in NYC. While on an expedition for the Mysterium. Her father spent lots of time away from home leaving her with her mother and their servants. The young Madam Mercurial sought approval from both her parents back then and her mother being a hidden agent of the throne saw great potential in Madam Mercurial. Her mother spent years trying to twist her mind to turn her into a good little agent of the throne. Using mental magic on the girl and good old fashion manipulation her mother tried to make Madam Mercurial murder her father and siblings. When the night came to put her mother's murderous plans into motion. Even though everything in her told her she wanted it. It was deeply terrifying seeing her plans go into motion. Seeing the pain she brought to her family brought on her </span> awaking <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> to try and stop herself from murdering her innocent little brother. Her awaking dragged into the deepest depths of pandemonium. Where she found herself falling through the holographic plane of reality. At this moment she could sense everything as if she was everywhere. Then she became a single point, in reality, an axis on which all of </span> reality <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> turned. When she looked up she saw her self-bound in soft silk bindings covering her eyes and mouth making her body move like a puppet. As she tried to rip the strands of sink she found herself too weak to do so. She continued to struggle when she heard a voice so sweet it made her look away from herself but before a woman standing upon a lake of sliver fire. The female figure had 10 wings and a mask over her face and told Madam Mercurial that the strands could not be broken but only cut with this tool. In the hand of the female figure was a large pair of curved ornate scissors. The woman told her to write her name on them. When she did she turned and began cutting the restrains on herself. When she did see her eyes opened back to the fallen world. Where she found that she stopped herself from killing her little brother. When she did her mother sensed the girls awakening and attacked. As she did the woman inside of the mind of Madam Mercurial her Goetic demon manifested itself and defended Madam Mercurial till forces of the Mysterium were able to get to her. During her rescue her mother escaped into the astral, vanishing deep inside. Once saved she saw the pain her father's eyes the betrayal he felt from her harming her family even if it was under the control of her mother's magic. From that day on she now seeks to regain her father's approval and forgiveness for what she has done. Now she focuses gaining enough power and skill to never be manipulated again. To never fall into another's plans to force her to make a choice she does not want too. Years have passed since she awakened at 10 years old. Now at 17, she is seen as a trusted member of the Mysterium. Even so, she still feels the coldness of her father's gaze. In her normal life, she works as a researcher at her families company known as the Silver corporation. She tries to avoid her brother and older sister out of shame for what she has done in her past. When she is free she spends almost every waking hour of her life honing her magic and her mind to a razor sharp edge. In the Mysterium, she works as a researcher also studying all of the artifacts brought back brought back explores. Her Familiar is a humanoid fox called Umbra</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName(