t_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Scissors</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">-1</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u2022</span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Enhance: Crafts</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span></div></td> </tr> </table></div> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Equipment On Person:</b> Smart Phone (+4), Multitool, Tablet (+5), Black Dress (+3), Book (Occult +1), Book (Romance)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Equipment: </b>Cache</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Beasts:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Experience:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Arcane Beats: </b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Arcane Experiences:</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Short Term Aspirations: </b>Finish Magical Theory Paper, Become an Explore</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Long Term Aspiration: </b>Gain Her Fathers Forgiveness/Approval</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Description: </b>Madam Mercurial has raven hair blacker than the deepest shadows and smoldering eyes that promises tastes of pleasures beyond what a mortal has seen. At 17 she looks 21 already and her mature attitude does not help this assumption. Often she likes to wear black dresses as dark as her raven hair. On her right hand sits an X shaped scar she got during her awakening. Her familiar is a black fox with<br /> purple eyes. When in a humanoid form it looks like an older woman in an office outfit.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Bio: </b>Second Born to the house of the Silver Needle. Madam Mercurial from a young age showed a great aptitude for anything she tried even magic. Many saw it as her just having a talent for things but no one saw how many hours she would spend studying and learning to gain the approval of her father. Her father is one of the 13 leaders of the Mysterium in NYC. While on an expedition for the Mysterium. Her father spent lots of time away from home leaving her with her mother and their servants. The young Madam Mercurial sought approval from both her parents back then and her mother being a hidden agent of the throne saw great potential in Madam Mercurial. Her mother spent years trying to twist her mind to turn her into a good little agent of the throne. Using mental magic on the girl and good old fashion manipulation her mother tried to make Madam Mercurial murder her father and siblings. When the night came to put her mother's murderous plans into motion. Even though everything in her told her she wanted it. It was deeply terrifying seeing her plans go into motion. Seeing the pain she brought to her family brought on her awaking to try and stop herself from murdering her innocent little brother. Her awaking dragged into the deepest depths of pandemonium. Where she found herself falling through the holographic plane of reality. At this moment she could sense everything as if she was everywhere. Then she became a single point, in reality, an axis on which all of reality turned. When she looked up she saw her self-bound in soft silk bindings covering her eyes and mouth making her body move like a puppet. As she tried to rip the strands of sink she found herself too weak to do so. She continued to struggle when she heard a voice so sweet it made her look away from herself but before a woman standing upon a lake of sliver fire. The female figure had 10 wings and a mask over her face and told Madam Mercurial that the strands could not be broken but only cut with this tool. In the hand of the female figure was a large pair of curved ornate scissors. The woman told her to write her name on them. When she did she turned and began cutting the restrains on herself. When she did see her eyes opened back to the fallen world. Where she found that she stopped herself from killing her little brother. When she did her mother sensed the girls awakening and attacked. As she did the woman inside of the mind of Madam Mercurial her Goetic demon manifested itself and defended Madam Mercurial till forces of the Mysterium were able to get to her. During her rescue her mother escaped into the astral, vanishing deep inside. Once saved she saw the pain her father's eyes the betrayal he felt from her harming her family even if it was under the control of her mother's magic. From that day on she now seeks to regain her father's approval and forgiveness for what she has done. Now she focuses gaining enough power and skill to never be manipulated again. To never fall into another's plans to force her to make a choice she does not want too. Years have passed since she awakened at 10 years old. Now at 17, she is seen as a trusted member of the Mysterium. Even so, she still feels the coldness of her father's gaze. In her normal life, she works as a researcher at her families company known as the Silver corporation. She tries to avoid her brother and older sister out of shame for what she has done in her past. When she is free she spends almost every waking hour of her life honing her magic and her mind to a razor sharp edge. In the Mysterium, she works as a researcher also studying all of the artifacts brought back brought back explores. Her Familiar is a humanoid fox called Umbra</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>RP Notes:</b> Madam Mercurial as her name implies she often changes her mind and plans to make it harder for people manipulate her. You can't plan for something when someone does the unexpected. She also hates green candy because it was her mother's favorite. Her voice deep and sultry for a 17 year old. </span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-25T14:30:33-07:00","id":1211565,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Jason L. Comeaux</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Teaching has been Jason's passion since he was a teenager when he would teach elementary school children. After </span> highschool <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> Jason got a chance to travel around the world and use that chance to study with monks china and various native American people in the U.S. After spending years just pack packing across the world he entered college. Where Jason started to really bloom. It's where he met his life partner. She joined the military and is currently serving overseas while he stays back in the states and teaching a local NYC high school. He teaches history and mixes it with a bit of philosophy for the kids. He actually 